  "[says] Wang Lung does not understand his sons' pride.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"What now?\"",
  "[action] The eldest son and the second son laugh.",
  "the eldest son: \"My father would be much more pleased to be called a rich man than to be called a poor man.\"",
  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung shouts at his sons.",
